    {
      "id": "35734026",
      "title": "Planning Data Submission",
      "sourceHash": "e03911573bc7946ec03eaab8735b5e3f22b63a28b55f9b548ea1cc432a5779e4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.07,
          "en": "Okay. Finally, now that we loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.07,
          "end": 6.6,
          "en": "a lot of data in a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.6,
          "end": 7.89,
          "en": "of different ways, and that we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.89,
          "end": 9.42,
          "en": "now hopefully get the hang",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.42,
          "end": 12.93,
          "en": "of how loading data works with React Router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.93,
          "end": 15.9,
          "en": "it's time to also send data to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.9,
          "end": 18.99,
          "en": "Because we, for example, get this edit form here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.99,
          "end": 21.75,
          "en": "but we could also be adding a new event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.75,
          "end": 22.62,
          "en": "And for that, of course, we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.62,
          "end": 24.72,
          "en": "wanna display a form here, as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.72,
          "end": 27.63,
          "en": "and then ultimately send the data from that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.63,
          "end": 29.823,
          "en": "to this dummy backend which we have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.08,
          "end": 33.54,
          "en": "Now, I'll start by displaying the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.54,
          "end": 36.72,
          "en": "For that I'll use that same event form component, here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.72,
          "end": 39.18,
          "en": "in my new event JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.18,
          "end": 42.78,
          "en": "Here we just return event form and include",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.78,
          "end": 45.393,
          "en": "that import to that component, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.89,
          "end": 49.71,
          "en": "Now, if we visit new event, we see that same form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.71,
          "end": 52.11,
          "en": "as we saw before when we clicked edit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.11,
          "end": 55.14,
          "en": "but, of course, without any pre-filled data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.14,
          "end": 57.693,
          "en": "because this is a new event which we add here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.56,
          "end": 59.7,
          "en": "Now, we wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.7,
          "end": 61.86,
          "en": "that whenever we click that save button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.86,
          "end": 63.57,
          "en": "and we enter in some data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 67.29,
          "en": "that data is sent to the backend API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.29,
          "end": 68.583,
          "en": "How can we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.53999999999999,
          "end": 71.76,
          "en": "Well, there are different approaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.76,
          "end": 74.61,
          "en": "We could add a function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.61,
          "end": 77.19,
          "en": "in our new event page component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.19,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "and give the function a name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 82.02,
          "en": "like Submit Handler, accept an event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.02,
          "end": 85.32,
          "en": "and that event would be the submit event of our form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.32,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "and we could call prevent default to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 91.17,
          "en": "that the browser does not automatically send a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.17,
          "end": 92.61,
          "en": "to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.61,
          "end": 95.37,
          "en": "And then we could extract data from the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.37,
          "end": 99.84,
          "en": "with help of two-way binding, or refs, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.84,
          "end": 103.56,
          "en": "And, we could then manually send our HTDP request here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.56,
          "end": 106.44,
          "en": "maybe manage some loading and error state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.44,
          "end": 107.94,
          "en": "and ultimately navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.94,
          "end": 110.013,
          "en": "away from this page, once we're done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.85,
          "end": 113.4,
          "en": "We could navigate away with imperative,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.4,
          "end": 115.02000000000001,
          "en": "and navigation, with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.02000000000001,
          "end": 118.59,
          "en": "of that use Navigate Hook I mentioned earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.59,
          "end": 120.24,
          "en": "in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.24,
          "end": 123.21,
          "en": "We could do all of that, but as you can probably",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.21,
          "end": 126.24,
          "en": "already tell by the fact that I'm saying could,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.24,
          "end": 129.603,
          "en": "there is a better approach when using React Router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 134.61,
          "en": "Just as we can add loaders to load data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 134.61,
          "end": 137.76,
          "en": "we can also add actions to send data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 137.76,
          "end": 139.803,
          "en": "and that is what we should do here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
